 "rule": "random.Random(int(sha256(\"20261113:a75d2-holdforms\")[:16 hex], 16)); the 36 stratum labels (gap_alone 4, gap_plus1 4, gap_plus2 4, short 6, zone_mid 2, zone_merge 2, zone_custom 2, pulse 4, taper 4, rolling 4) are shuffled = draw order. Every plan: trigger lanes, slots 1, gate / start_gate / phases / lc_target none, spread_m in {200,300}; (lane, rank) slots distinct, roles sorted by (lane, rank); per role v_w in {8..24 step 2}, dmax in {1.0,1.5}, onset_s in {0,10,20,40,60,90} (if no role has onset 0 the first role gets 0; rolling excepted), hold_s in {5,10,20,30,45,60,90,120,180}; cooldown_s in {H, H+30, 60, 120} with H = max role hold_s. gap: one gap role on SUMO lane 1 (rank 0/1): start gap, gap_dx_lo {-20,-10,0}, gap_dx_hi {20,40,60}, gap_drop_m {none,150,300,600}, gap_arm_s {30,60,120}, gap_release {timer,clear}, gap_events {1,3}, hold_s {5,10,15,20}, dv_rel {none,2,4,6,8}, v_w in {0} + V_W grid when dv_rel is set (else V_W grid); + 0/1/2 ordinary roles in SUMO lanes 1/2; zone in {near,mid,merge}. short: hold_s in {10,20,30,45} per role, zone in {far,full,near}. zone_*: zone mid / merge / custom with zone_d = (d_up in {1800,1400,1000,700,400}, d_down in {1000,600,400,200,100}, d_up - d_down >= 200). pulse: role 1 pulsed, every other role pulsed with p 0.5: pulse_on_s, pulse_off_s in {5,10,20}, hold_s in the grid with hold_s >= on + off. taper: role 1 tapered, others with p 0.5: taper_in_s, taper_out_s in {0,5,10,20} not both 0, hold_s in the grid with hold_s >= in + out. rolling: 2-4 roles, onsets = 0 then sorted distinct draws from {10,20,40,60,90}, assigned in role order. short / pulse / taper / rolling use zone in {far,full,near}. Every plan in a75_holdforms.canonical form; a plan the executor refuses (executor_refusal) or whose a75 strategy_key was already drawn is redrawn in place (same stratum). No selection, no replacement afterwards",
